  "description": "The Lost Vape Ursa Epoch Pod Kit redefines the standards for pod vaping. Equipped with a powerful 1000mAh internal battery, this kit offers long-lasting vaping capabilities, suitable for extended sessions without the need for frequent recharging. With a maximum output of 25W, the Ursa Epoch delivers rich flavour and dense vapour production that will satisfy both new and experienced vapers. The integrated 0.42-inch OLED display provides essential vaping data in real-time, ensuring you are always in control of your vaping experience. This kit's adjustable airflow system allows for a customizable draw, catering to both tight MTL and more open vape preferences, making it a versatile choice for diverse vaping needs. Designed with practicality in mind, the Ursa Epoch features a stepless airflow control that offers precise adjustments for the perfect draw. Its ergonomic build and unique soft-touch silicone wrap ensures it fits comfortably in your hand, enhancing its portability and ease of use. The kit is compatible with Ursa V2 Pods, which supports a range of coil resistances, allowing you to fine-tune your vaping experience. Whether at home or on the go, the Ursa Epoch Pod Kit is an excellent companion for anyone seeking a reliable and stylish vaping solution. Available in six eye-catching colours. Check out our vape juice and pair it perfectly with this kit. Note: Only Firefly Planet colourway features a glow-in-the-dark skin. Please Note: When filling your pod with e-liquid for the first time, allow the pod to sit for ten minutes before use. This will allow the e-liquid to better saturate the wicking material, a type of cotton, to prevent dry hits and ensure the best flavour and performance from your coil.",
